1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:03,052
Can your AirPods charge in someone else's case?

2
00:00:03,102 --> 00:00:03,358
Yes.

3
00:00:03,408 --> 00:00:04,646
But there's a catch.

4
00:00:05,050 --> 00:00:07,538
The secret is hidden inside this tiny case.

5
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:12,779
Magnets guide the earbuds into position, lining up their tiny charging contacts.

6
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:18,150
Once those metal contacts connect, the case delivers power directly to the earbuds.

7
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:23,548
Power travels from the case's battery, through its charging circuit, into each AirPod.

8
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:26,401
But charging is only part of the story.

9
00:00:26,451 --> 00:00:30,696
Your iPhone may notice the AirPods and case don't belong together.

10
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:36,776
A compatible case may charge your AirPods, but different models aren't always interchangeable.

11
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:40,682
So yes, another compatible case can charge your AirPods.

12
00:00:40,732 --> 00:00:42,596
But not every case will work.
